Cutcord
Maintained by drainingwish
Source: https://github.com/drainingwish/VencordFork

Cutcord is a modified version of Vencord incorporating plugins and code from
Equicord. It is an independently maintained fork.

Original Vencord copyright: Vendicated and contributors.
Equicord code and imported plugins retain their original copyright notices
and author credits. Those notices, third-party licenses, and the GNU General
Public License in LICENSE continue to apply.

Modifications dated 2026-10-14:
- Integrated the additional user plugins into the bundled plugin directory.
- Updated plugin imports and catalog generation while retaining author credits.
- Applied Cutcord branding and removed donation prompts.
- Configured development releases for the Cutcord repository.
- Adapted imported plugins and shared APIs to this fork's interfaces.

